# Organization GitHub Configuration

This repository manages shared GitHub configuration for the `zerath-company` organization.

It contains:

- the public organization profile in `profile/README.md`
- shared pull request and issue templates
- organization-level GitHub Actions workflows
- supporting automation and maintenance files

## Structure

- `profile/` - organization profile assets and README
- `ISSUE_TEMPLATE/` - default issue templates
- `PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md` - default pull request template
- `workflows/` - shared workflow definitions
- `dependabot.yml` - dependency update configuration

## Notes

Changes in this repository affect how the organization is presented and how contributors interact with shared GitHub defaults.
